Subject: [PATCH 144/144] GreatDANE: fail if a non-excluded *coin.surf product
 URL remains (round 5a)

Add no_coin_surf_product_urls_check.py with an explicit exclusion list
for publisher fixtures, historical evidence/, the check script itself,
author emails, node seeds, and the PepeNet desktop releases URL. The
greatdane.doge tile is not a *coin.surf host and is out of scope.
